  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "カラフジム　ジムリーダーハイダイが　忘れていった　サイフ。マリナードタウンの市場に　届けよう。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "카라프체육관의 체육관 관장 곤포가 놓고 간 지갑. 마리네이드마을의 시장으로 가져가자.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "玻瓶道館的道館館主海岱忘記帶走的錢包。請把它送去漬沁鎮的市場。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un portefeuille oublié par Kombu, le Champion de l’Arène de Jarramanca. Vous devez vous rendre au marché de Porto Marinada pour le lui rendre.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Die Geldbörse, welche Kombu, der Arenaleiter von Garrafosa City, vergessen hat. Überreiche sie ihm auf dem Markt von Puerto Marinedo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "La cartera olvidada de Fuco, el Líder de Gimnasio de Ciudad Cántara. Búscalo en el mercado de Pueblo Marinada para entregársela.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Portafogli dimenticato da Algaro, il Capopalestra di Garrafopoli. Vai al mercato di Marinada per restituirlo al legittimo proprietario.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A wallet that was left behind by Kofu, the Gym Leader at the Cascarrafa Gym. You’re to deliver it to him at the market in Porto Marinada.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "カラフジム　ジムリーダーハイダイが　忘れていった　サイフ。マリナードタウンの市場に　届けよう。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "玻瓶道馆道馆馆主海岱忘记带的钱包。到渍沁镇的市场交给他吧。",
